				"code" : "franjaConversations := Dictionary new.\r\nfranjaConversations at: 'Mañana' put: OrderedCollection new.\r\nfranjaConversations at: 'Tarde' put: OrderedCollection new.\r\nfranjaConversations at: 'Noche' put: OrderedCollection new.\rfranjaConversations."
